{"msg":"操作成功!","data":{"guideTitle":"错题打印使用手册","guideId":14,"guideContent":"<div class=\"mb-32\">1、选择需要打印的文件，点击【打印】按钮或点击文件，在预览页点击打印按钮</div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/wrongTopicPrint/pic_1_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/wrongTopicPrint/pic_2_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">2、进入打印设置页，点击左上角按钮展开下拉菜单的【所有打印机】</div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/wrongTopicPrint/pic_3_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        3、若为能自动发射wifi的打印机，且与学习机连接在同一个局域网内，则可自动搜索打印机。若为普通wifi打印机，则点击【添加打印机】\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/wrongTopicPrint/pic_4_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        4、点击【默认打印服务】\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/wrongTopicPrint/pic_5_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        5、在弹出的弹框中手动输入打印机ip地址\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/wrongTopicPrint/pic_6_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        6、添加打印机成功后点击【返回】按钮返回打印页\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/wrongTopicPrint/pic_7_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        7、在打印预览页，点击打印按钮进行打印\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/wrongTopicPrint/pic_8_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />"},"status":0}